      "headline": "TikTok pushed a 2004 song past 1 billion Spotify streams",
      "snippet": "Eminem's 2004 song \"Mockingbird\" crossed 1 billion Spotify streams, as XXL reported on March 16, 2023. It had only about 500 million streams in April 2022, even though it was a hit on release and peaked at No. 11 on the Billboard Hot 100. The revival came mostly from TikTok. Sped-up versions and vocal covers of the song's ending helped drive it.",
      "context": "XXL reported the milestone on March 16, 2023.",
